---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About MyZooTwin — A curious animal learning journal"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">About the project</p><h1>A little more<br /><em>curiosity,</em> every day.</h1><p>MyZooTwin is an independent educational and editorial project about animals. We are creating a welcoming place to discover species, understand behavior, live thoughtfully with pets, and stay connected to the natural world.</p></section><section class="about-grid"><div><h2>Built for<br /><em>good questions.</em></h2></div><div><p>There is no single way to care about animals. Some people arrive through a beloved pet, others through a bird at the window, a documentary, a field trip, or a question that will not go away.</p><p>MyZooTwin will grow slowly and carefully: useful explanations, honest field notes, and stories that invite a closer look.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.page-intro{padding:clamp(5rem,12vw,10rem) clamp(1.2rem,10vw,10rem);background:var(--cream)}.page-intro h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,8vw,7rem);margin:1rem 0 2rem}.page-intro h1 em,.about-grid h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold)}.page-intro>p:last-child{font-size:1.2rem;max-width:38rem;color:var(--muted)}.about-grid{max-width:1100px;padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem) clamp(1.2rem,5vw,5rem);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem}.about-grid h2{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.about-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}@media(max-width:650px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}}
</style>
